transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"42:24"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بِذَاتِ","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bidhāti","verse_key":"42:24"},{"pos":22,"ar":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","en_gloss":"(is in) the breasts","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","verse_key":"42:24"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:24"}]},{"verse_key":"42:25","surah":42,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى يَقْبَلُ ٱلتَّوْبَةَ عَنْ عِبَادِهِۦ وَيَعْفُوا۟ عَنِ ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ وَيَعْلَمُ مَا تَفْعَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is He who accepts repentance from His servants and pardons bad deeds- He knows everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَقْبَلُ","en_gloss":"accepts","transliteration":"yaqbalu","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلتَّوْبَةَ","en_gloss":"the repentance","transliteration":"l-tawbata","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"His slaves","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَيَعْفُوا۟","en_gloss":"and pardons","transliteration":"wayaʿfū","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","en_gloss":"the evil","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَيَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"and He knows","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَفْعَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"tafʿalūna","verse_key":"42:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:25"}]},{"verse_key":"42:26","surah":42,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَجِيبُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَعَمِلُوا۟ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ وَيَزِيدُهُم مِّن فَضْلِهِۦ ۚ وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ لَهُمْ عَذَابٌ شَدِيدٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He responds to those who believe and do good deeds, and gives them more of His bounty; agonizing torment awaits the disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَيَسْتَجِيبُ","en_gloss":"And He answers","transliteration":"wayastajību","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and do","transliteration":"waʿamilū","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"righteous deeds","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَزِيدُهُم","en_gloss":"and increases (for) them","transliteration":"wayazīduhum","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"His Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlihi","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْكَـٰفِرُونَ","en_gloss":"And the disbelievers ","transliteration":"wal-kāfirūna","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَذَابٌۭ","en_gloss":"(will be) a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَدِيدٌۭ","en_gloss":"severe","transliteration":"shadīdun","verse_key":"42:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:26"}]},{"verse_key":"42:27","surah":42,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَلَوْ بَسَطَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلرِّزْقَ لِعِبَادِهِۦ لَبَغَوْا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَـٰكِن يُنَزِّلُ بِقَدَرٍ مَّا يَشَآءُ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ بِعِبَادِهِۦ خَبِيرٌۢ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If God were to grant His plentiful provision to [all] His creatures, they would act insolently on earth, but He sends down in due measure whatever He will, for He is well aware of His servants and watchful over them:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَسَطَ","en_gloss":"Allah extends","transliteration":"basaṭa","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah extends","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلرِّزْقَ","en_gloss":"the provision","transliteration":"l-riz'qa","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِعِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"for His slaves","transliteration":"liʿibādihi","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَبَغَوْا۟","en_gloss":"surely they would rebel","transliteration":"labaghaw","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُنَزِّلُ","en_gloss":"He sends down","transliteration":"yunazzilu","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِقَدَرٍۢ","en_gloss":"in (due) measure","transliteration":"biqadarin","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","en_gloss":"Indeed, He","transliteration":"innahu","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بِعِبَادِهِۦ","en_gloss":"of His slaves","transliteration":"biʿibādihi","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خَبِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīrun","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"42:27"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:27"}]},{"verse_key":"42:28","surah":42,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَهُوَ ٱلَّذِى يُنَزِّلُ ٱلْغَيْثَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا قَنَطُوا۟ وَيَنشُرُ رَحْمَتَهُۥ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْوَلِىُّ ٱلْحَمِيدُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"it is He who sends relief through rain after they have lost hope, and spreads His mercy far and wide. He is the Protector, Worthy of All Praise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"(is) the One Who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُنَزِّلُ","en_gloss":"sends down","transliteration":"yunazzilu","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْغَيْثَ","en_gloss":"the rain","transliteration":"l-ghaytha","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَنَطُوا۟","en_gloss":"they have despaired","transliteration":"qanaṭū","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَيَنشُرُ","en_gloss":"and spreads","transliteration":"wayanshuru","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَحْمَتَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"His mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatahu","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"And He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْوَلِىُّ","en_gloss":"(is) the Protector","transliteration":"l-waliyu","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْحَمِيدُ","en_gloss":"the Praiseworthy","transliteration":"l-ḥamīdu","verse_key":"42:28"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٨","en_gloss":"(28)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"42:28"}]},{"verse_key":"42:29","surah":42,"ayah":29,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ خَلْقُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَثَّ فِيهِمَا مِن دَآبَّةٍ ۚ وَهُوَ عَلَىٰ جَمْعِهِمْ إِذَا يَشَآءُ قَدِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Among His signs is the creation of the heavens and earth and all the living creatures He has scattered throughout them: He has the power to gather them all together whenever He will.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمِنْ","en_gloss":"And among","transliterati